{"articleNo":"2067","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=2067&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[추가모집] 앱 S/W 개발 경진대회 재공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.10.13","hit":"8263","attachments":[{"name":"(재공고)앱SW공모전1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2067&attachNo=71257"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"663\" border=\"0\">\n    \n        <tbody>\n            <tr>\n                <td bgcolor=\"#f7f7f7\" colspan=\"7\">\n                <div style=\"PADDING-RIGHT: 11px; PADDING-LEFT: 20px; PADDING-BOTTOM: 11px; PADDING-TOP: 11px\">\n                <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"94%\" border=\"0\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><span class=\"style3\"><span class=\"style3\"><font color=\"#666666\">안녕하세요?<br>창업진흥센터입니다<br>학생들이&nbsp;\"앱 S/W개발 경진대회\" 추가작품의 접수를 부탁해&nbsp;접수연장을&nbsp; 실시합니다.<br><br>\"앱 S/W개발 경진대회\"에 출품가능한 작품은 아이폰(아이패드)와 안드로이드계열에서 활용가능한<br>앱 S/W를 대상으로 합니다.<br><br>참신한 아이디어와 끼를 가진 앱을 개발하고자 하는 학생의 많은 참석을 부탁드립니다.<br><br>자세한 내용은&nbsp;아래 내용을 참고하세요.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 아&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 -<br><br><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--> </font>\n                            <p class=\"HStyle0\">\n                            </p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=